ial EM and Energy support."},{"name":"Master Key","text":"Craftable EM and Energy option for players without the event weapon."},{"name":"Forest Regalia","text":"ER secondary stat and a collectible EM-granting Leaf after Bloom; pickup can be inconvenient. Bloom teams; teammate must collect Leaf. R5 improves EM buff."},{"name":"Sacrificial Greatsword","text":"A second Skill can generate more Hydro particles and help battery an ally, but is less flexible than Favonius. Works best with high refinement. High refinement preferred."},{"name":"Katsuragikiri Nagamasa","text":"Craftable ER weapon with a flat Energy refund that helps stabilize Burst uptime. Useful when already crafted/refined."}],"a":[{"names":["Silken Moon's Serenade"],"text":"Best Lunar support set: grants ER, team EM and Lunar Reaction DMG bonuses.","stats":"ER/EM · EM · EM/CR"},{"names":["Instructor"],"text":"Aino triggers an on-field reaction to grant teamwide EM.","stats":"ER/EM · EM · EM/CR"},{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"Burst grants an ATK buff to the whole team; best when teammates value ATK more than EM.","stats":"ER · EM/Hydro · CR/EM"}],"t":[{"name":"Moonlit Circuit","members":["Aino","Flins","Kuki Shinobu","Sucrose"],"text":"Flins drives Lunar-Charged; Aino enables Ascendant Gleam and Hydro, Shinobu supplies Electro/healing, and Sucrose shreds RES and shares EM.","roles":["Off-field DPS / Enabler","On-field DPS","Healer / Reaction Trigger","EM Buffer / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Ducky Power Grid","members":["Aino","Ineffa","Ororon","Ifa"],"text":"Aino and Ineffa enable Ascendant Gleam and Lunar-Charged. Ororon adds Electro damage, while Ifa drives reactions and boosts them.","roles":["Off-field DPS / Enabler","Off-field DPS / Shielder","Off-field DPS / Battery","On-field Driver"]},{"name":"Overvape Fireworks","members":["Aino","Yoimiya","Ineffa","Bennett"],"text":"Aino and Ineffa enable Ascendant Gleam, Hydro and Lunar-Charged; Bennett buffs Yoimiya. Vaporize consistency remains matchup-dependent.","roles":["Off-field DPS / Enabler","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Shielder","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Ducky Hyperbloom","members":["Aino","Baizhu","Raiden Shogun","Xingqiu"],"text":"Xingqiu supplies reliable Hydro, Baizhu applies Dendro and heals, Raiden triggers Hyperbloom; Aino adds off-field Hydro and team buffs.","roles":["Off-field DPS / Enabler","Healer / Shielder","Reaction Trigger","Off-field DPS / Hydro Enabler"]}],"v":"Lunar-Charged: 4pc Silken Moon, Favonius/Makhaira; pair with Flins or Ineffa to activate Ascendant Gleam.\nOvervape: With Ineffa and a slow-Pyro DPS, use Silken Moon and reliable Burst uptime; Vape is not guaranteed.\nHyperbloom: Use Aino as secondary Hydro with Xingqiu/Yelan, Dendro and an EM Electro trigger; never solo Hydro.\nATK Buffer: Noblesse or Makhaira in ATK-scaling teams; use only if Energy and Lunar buff coverage are handled.","n":3},"seo":{"roles":["Support / Sub DPS"],"about":"Aino is an off-field Hydro support whose Burst enables reactions while her Moonsign passive raises the team's Moonsign level. Pair her with another Nod-Krai character for Ascendant Gleam, improving her Hydro application and Silken Moon buffs. Prioritize Burst uptime.","pros":["Off-field Hydro application","Boosts Moonsign level","Strong Lunar team support","Free story character"],"cons":["Modest personal damage","Burst reliant","Limited Hydro application","Wants Nod-Krai teammate"],"weapons":["Favonius Greatsword","Makhaira Aquamarine","Flame-Forged Insight","Master Key","Forest Regalia","Sacrificial Greatsword","Katsuragikiri Nagamasa"],"arts":[{"sets":["Silken Moon's Serenade"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Best"},{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""}],"main":["Energy Recharge / Elemental Mastery","Elemental Mastery / Hydro DMG","CRIT Rate / Elemental Mastery"],"stats":["ER: 155% - 205% (C0 Favonius)","ER: 190% - 250%+ (C0 no Fav)","ER: 125% - 165% (C4 Favonius)","ER: 100% - 140% (Flame-Forged)","CRIT Rate: 40% - 60% (Fav)"],"vars":[{"title":"Lunar-Charged EM Support","role":"Off-field Support","weapons":["Makhaira Aquamarine","Favonius Greatsword","Flame-Forged Insight","Master Key"],"arts":[{"sets":["Silken Moon's Serenade"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Reach ER first, then emphasize EM; add CRIT Rate with Favonius.","teams":"Flins or Ineffa; second Nod-Krai character for Ascendant Gleam.","when":"Best for Moonsign and Lunar-Charged teams needing Hydro, EM buffs, and a short team rotation.","cond":"Aino plus another Nod-Krai unit enables Ascendant Gleam.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Overvape Support","role":"Off-field Support","weapons":["Favonius Greatsword","Makhaira Aquamarine","Master Key"],"arts":[{"sets":["Silken Moon's Serenade"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Focus on ER and team buffs; personal damage is secondary.","teams":"Ineffa plus a slower-applying Pyro damage dealer such as Yoimiya.","when":"Provides Hydro, Lunar-Charged and EM buffs for mixed Vape/Overloaded teams.","cond":"Vaporize timing can be inconsistent; do not rely on Aino as solo Hydro for faster Pyro application.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Hyperbloom Secondary Hydro","role":"Reaction Support","weapons":["Favonius Greatsword","Forest Regalia","Master Key"],"arts":[{"sets":["Silken Moon's Serenade"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER until Burst uptime is secure; EM is secondary if Aino rarely owns Bloom reactions.","teams":"Dendro + EM-built Electro trigger + a primary Hydro applicator.","when":"Adds some Hydro and buffs while teammates generate and trigger most Dendro Cores.","cond":"Aino alone does not provide enough Hydro for consistent core production.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Noblesse ATK Buffer","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Greatsword","Makhaira Aquamarine","Sacrificial Greatsword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER/EM Sands, CRIT Rate if Favonius; skip personal-damage targets.","teams":"ATK-scaling carry; no better Noblesse wearer in the team.","when":"Use when ATK buffs offer more value than Lunar buffs or another teammate already holds Silken Moon.","cond":"Noblesse 4pc buff does not stack with another Noblesse user.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Varunada Lazurite Sliver","Varunada Lazurite Fragment","Varunada Lazurite Chunk","Varunada Lazurite Gemstone","Precision Kuuvahki Stamping Die","Teachings of Elysium","Guide to Elysium","Philosophies of Elysium","Broken Drive Shaft","Reinforced Drive Shaft","Precision Drive Shaft","Portable Bearing","Silken Feather","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 6+"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 6-8"}],"teams":[{"name":"Moonlit Circuit","members":["Aino","Flins","Kuki Shinobu","Sucrose"]},{"name":"Ducky Power Grid","members":["Aino","Ineffa","Ororon","Ifa"]},{"name":"Overvape Fireworks","members":["Aino","Yoimiya","Ineffa","Bennett"]},{"name":"Ducky Hyperbloom","members":["Aino","Baizhu","Raiden Shogun","Xingqiu"]}]}}],"title":"Aino","el":"Hydro"}